        <p>G. T. P. 6. T. I' Leeds Salford 0 " 6 Hunslet 0 0 0 Oldham 2 210 Huddersfield ... 0 2 G Rochdale Hornets 2 8 28 Wakefield Trin... 0 0 0 Wigan St Helens 1 5 17 Swinton .... ..... 0 0 0 Batley Dewsbury Broughton Rang 0 0 0 Hull Widnes 8 14 5S Coventry Keighley 0 1 :3 Bramley 0 1 3 Barrow 0 3 9 Runcorn 0 0 0 NORTHERN RUGBY COMBINATION. Purston — 23 Hunslet — 6 Halifax A 1 4 16 Batley A Dewsbury A — 32 Wakefield T A... 0 0 0 Swinton A Salfori A — 16 Wigan Hightleid -- 9 Leigh Shamrocks 2 1 7 Widnes A Leigh A — 13 Pemberton ...... 0 0 0 Rochdale H A " 0 4 Runcorn A Wigan A Oldham A 13 Huddersfield ... 0 0 '0</p>
